{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Arbeh.</b> A species name; perhaps it is called thus because it is more numerous than the other species, as it is written: 'what the arbeh left, the gazam consumed' (Joel 1:4), and concerning it is written: 'my great army' (Joel 2:25), and if so, the alef is additive."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:04.983319212Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}